graph TD
    A[Pre-mRNA Formation] --> B{Splicing Type?}
    B -->|Constitutive| C[U1 snRNP Binding]
    B -->|Alternative| D[Alternative Splice Site]
    B -->|Self-Splicing| E[Intron Catalysis]
    
    C --> F[5' Splice Site Recognition]
    F --> G[U2 snRNP Binding]
    G --> H[Branch Point Recognition]
    H --> I[U4/U6 snRNP Binding]
    I --> J[Spliceosome Assembly]
    J --> K[First Transesterification]
    K --> L[Second Transesterification]
    L --> M[Exon Ligation]
    M --> N[Splicing Complete]
    
    D --> O[Alternative Spliceosome]
    O --> P[Alternative Splicing]
    P --> N
    
    E --> Q[Intron Self-Cleavage]
    Q --> R[Exon Joining]
    R --> N
    
    %% Regulation
    N --> S[Splicing Status]
    S --> T{Splicing Required?}
    T -->|Yes| U[Splicing Activation]
    T -->|No| V[Splicing Inhibition]
    
    %% Key proteins
    W[U1 snRNP] --> C
    X[U2 snRNP] --> G
    Y[U4/U6 snRNP] --> I
    Z[Spliceosome] --> J
    AA[Splicing Factors] --> N
    BB[Alternative Splicing Factors] --> O
    
    %% Styling
    style A fill:#ffd1d1
    style B fill:#bbdefb
    style C fill:#b59d00
    style D fill:#f4a261
    style E fill:#f4a261
